sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant OGX as OGX Server<br/>8321/TCP HTTP
    participant vLLM as vLLM Endpoint<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant vLLMEmbed as vLLM Embedding<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP
    participant VectorDB as Vector DB<br/>(Milvus/pgvector/Qdrant)
    participant Tools as Tool Providers<br/>(Brave/Tavily/MCP)
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 1: Inference Request
    Client->>OGX: POST /v1/inference/chat_completion<br/>Auth: OAuth2 JWT (conditional)
    OGX->>vLLM: Forward inference request<br/>Auth: Bearer token (VLLM_API_TOKEN)
    vLLM-->>OGX: Completion response
    OGX->>PG: Store conversation log<br/>Auth: Username/password
    PG-->>OGX: Ack
    OGX-->>Client: JSON response

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 2: RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation)
    Client->>OGX: POST /v1/files/upload<br/>Auth: OAuth2 JWT (conditional)
    OGX->>PG: Store file metadata<br/>Auth: Username/password
    OGX->>S3: Store file content<br/>Auth: AWS IAM
    S3-->>OGX: Upload confirmed
    OGX-->>Client: File ID

    Client->>OGX: POST /v1/tool_runtime/file_search<br/>Auth: OAuth2 JWT (conditional)
    OGX->>vLLMEmbed: Generate embeddings<br/>Auth: Bearer token
    vLLMEmbed-->>OGX: Embedding vectors
    OGX->>VectorDB: Query similar vectors<br/>Auth: Token/password/API key
    VectorDB-->>OGX: Matching documents
    OGX-->>Client: Search results

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 3: Agentic Response
    Client->>OGX: POST /v1/responses<br/>Auth: OAuth2 JWT (conditional)
    OGX->>vLLM: Inference request<br/>Auth: Bearer token
    vLLM-->>OGX: Response with tool calls
    OGX->>Tools: Execute tool (web search)<br/>Auth: API key (HTTPS/443)
    Tools-->>OGX: Tool results
    OGX->>vLLM: Follow-up inference<br/>Auth: Bearer token
    vLLM-->>OGX: Final response
    OGX->>PG: Persist agent state<br/>Auth: Username/password
    PG-->>OGX: Ack
    OGX-->>Client: Agentic response with citations
